    "markdown": "![ACL Logo](https://aclanthology.org/images/acl-logo.svg) ACL Anthology ⟨1⟩\n  * About⟨2⟩\n    * Announcements⟨3⟩\n    * Communication channels⟨4⟩\n    * Related work⟨5⟩\n    * Copyright⟨6⟩\n    * * * *\n    * Credits⟨7⟩\n    * Volunteer⟨8⟩\n    * Development⟨9⟩\n    * Feedback⟨10⟩\n  * Using⟨2⟩\n    * Citing papers⟨11⟩\n    * Links in the Anthology⟨12⟩\n    * Data access⟨13⟩\n    * * * *\n    * All FAQs⟨14⟩\n    * * * *\n    * ###### Details\n    * Anthology identifiers⟨15⟩\n    * Names⟨16⟩\n    * ORCID iDs⟨17⟩\n    * DOIs⟨18⟩\n    * Verified authors⟨19⟩\n  * Contributions⟨2⟩\n    * Submissions⟨20⟩\n    * Corrections⟨21⟩\n    * Author pages⟨22⟩\n    * Attachments⟨23⟩\n  * GitHub⟨24⟩\n\n\n##  Stuart C. Shapiro ⟨22⟩\nAlso published as: S.C. Shapiro\n* * *\n#### 2001\npdf ⟨25⟩bib ⟨26⟩\n**Book Reviews: Knowledge Representation: Logical, Philosophical, and Computational Foundations⟨27⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nComputational Linguistics, Volume 27, Number 2, June 2001⟨29⟩\n#### 1998\npdf ⟨30⟩bib ⟨31⟩\n**Algorithms for Ontological Mediation⟨32⟩**  \nAlistair E. Campbell⟨33⟩ | Stuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nUsage of WordNet in Natural Language Processing Systems⟨34⟩\n#### 1989\npdf ⟨35⟩bib ⟨36⟩\n**Natural Language with Integrated Deictic and Graphic Gestures⟨37⟩**  \nJ.G. Neal⟨38⟩ | C.Y. Thielman⟨39⟩ | Z. Dobes⟨40⟩ | S.M. Haller⟨41⟩ | S.C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nSpeech and Natural Language: Proceedings of a Workshop Held at Cape Cod, Massachusetts, October 15-18, 1989⟨42⟩\n#### 1984\npdf ⟨43⟩bib ⟨44⟩\n**Quasi-Indexical Reference in Propositional Semantic Networks⟨45⟩**  \nWilliam J. Rapaport⟨46⟩ | Stuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \n10th International Conference on Computational Linguistics and 22nd Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics⟨47⟩\n#### 1982\npdf ⟨48⟩bib ⟨49⟩\n**A Knowledge Engineering Approach to Natural Language Understanding⟨50⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩ | Jeannette G. Neal⟨38⟩  \n20th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics⟨51⟩\npdf ⟨52⟩bib ⟨53⟩\n**Generalized Augmented Transition Network Grammars for Generation from Semantic Networks⟨54⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nAmerican Journal of Computational Linguistics, Volume 8, Number 1, January-March 1982⟨55⟩\n#### 1979\npdf ⟨56⟩bib ⟨57⟩\n**Generalized Augmented Transitiom Network Grammars for Generation From Semantic Networks⟨58⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \n17th Annual Meeting of the Association for Computational Linguistics⟨59⟩\n#### 1978\npdf ⟨60⟩bib ⟨61⟩\n**Path-Based and Node-Based Inference in Semantic Networks⟨62⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nTheoretical Issues in Natural Language Processing-2⟨63⟩\npdf ⟨64⟩bib ⟨65⟩\n**Path-Based and Node-Based Inference in Semantic Networks⟨66⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nAmerican Journal of Computational Linguistics (December 1978)⟨67⟩\n#### 1975\npdf ⟨68⟩bib ⟨69⟩\n**Generation as Parsing from a Network into a Linear String⟨70⟩**  \nStuart C. Shapiro⟨28⟩  \nAmerican Journal of Computational Linguistics (November 1975)⟨71⟩\nSearch⟨72⟩\n##### Co-authors\n  * Jeannette G. Neal⟨38⟩ 2\n  * Alistair E. Campbell⟨33⟩ 1\n  * Z. Dobes⟨40⟩ 1\n  * Susan Haller⟨41⟩ 1\n  * William J. Rapaport⟨46⟩ 1\nshow all...\n  * C.Y. Thielman⟨39⟩ 1\n\n\n##### Venues\n  * CL⟨73⟩4\n  * ACL⟨74⟩3\n  * COLING⟨75⟩1\n  * HLT⟨76⟩1\n  * TINLAP⟨77⟩1\nshow all...\n  * WS⟨78⟩1\n\n\n Fix author⟨79⟩\n![Creative Commons License](https://i.creativecommons.org/l/by/4.0/88x31.png)⟨80⟩ ACL materials are Copyright © 1963–2026 ACL; other materials are copyrighted by their respective copyright holders. Materials prior to 2016 here are licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 3.0 International License⟨81⟩. Permission is granted to make copies for the purposes of teaching and research. Materials published in or after 2016 are licensed on a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License⟨82⟩.\nThe ACL Anthology is managed and built by the ACL Anthology team⟨7⟩ of volunteers.\n_Site last built